| **Informix** | `jdbc:informix-sqli:` |
| **NetSuite** | `jdbc:ns:` |
| **OTS** | `jdbc:ots:http:`, `jdbc:ots:https:` |
| **ODPS** | `jdbc:odps:http:`, `jdbc:odps:https:` |
